## Frontend .env (Vite)
## IMPORTANT:
## - Never put real secrets into the frontend.
## - Any var prefixed with VITE_ can be exposed to the browser.
##
## For this hackathon demo:
## - keep API keys on a backend server (recommended)
## - put only non-secret config here

# Backend base URL (mahalliy yoki ngrok HTTPS, oxirida / qo‘ymang)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Ngrok misol (backend tunnel):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://abc123.ngrok-free.app

